          "good": false,
          "decisions": [
            {
              "about": "The slices",
              "decided": "Seven slices, in this order. First, a role held to the commands its rules name, laid by lay.py write from a proposal. It carries S2 and S4. Second, lay.py print, which shows the steps as they'll read and refuses a proposal that can't stand. It carries S1. Third, a result only from the result script, and the starts in the order of the routes from a run's call to its end. It carries S3 and S5. Fourth, each step held in its order by its trace, with the other types of rule the steps call for. It carries S4. Fifth, a start with only the text the plugin gives, a role resumed with the main conversation's grounds and the person's words, and a route that waits until the person's command. It carries S3. Sixth, a run picked up at the run port. It carries S6. Seventh, lay.py up. It carries S7.",
              "by": "reasoning"
            }
          ]
        },
